Deploy key placeholder.

The private key that used to live here has been removed: committing a real
private key to a repository is unsafe even as an example, and it trips secret
scanners.

Generate your own keypair instead:

    ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f projects/my-project/deploy-key -C "foundry-my-project" -N ""

Add the resulting deploy-key.pub as a deploy key on your forge, and reference
the private key from git-config.json. Private keys are gitignored.
